 5→### Sine Wave Deformation
 6→```vex
 7→float amp = chf("amplitude");
 8→float freq = chf("frequency");
 9→float offset = chf("offset");
10→@P.y += sin(@P.x * freq + offset + @Time) * amp;
11→```
