21→### Twist Deformation
22→```vex
23→float twist_amount = chf("twist") * @P.y;
24→float c = cos(twist_amount);
25→float s = sin(twist_amount);
26→float x = @P.x * c - @P.z * s;
27→float z = @P.x * s + @P.z * c;
28→@P.x = x;
29→@P.z = z;
30→```
